764..840 Comment "/// A list\'s entries and its tail summed at once: an entry\'s sum descends on"
841..919 Comment "/// the element code, the list code\'s field, but the tail\'s stands at the list"
920..996 Comment "/// code `ListL(a)` itself. The tail is below the value, and the value is no"
997..1031 Comment "/// parameter the fixpoint stages."
